# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Client configuration. `.env.example` is committed and holds no value;
# everything else may hold a real project URL and publishable key, and a
# developer machine may additionally carry a database connection string for
# migrations. docs/CLOUD_MULTIUSER_ARCHITECTURE.md §19: nothing secret is ever
# committed, and `npm run build` fails if secret key material reaches the
# bundle.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Supabase CLI working state: the linked project ref and temporary files.
supabase/.branches
supabase/.temp

# Vercel CLI working state: local project-link metadata, never source.
.vercel/

# A safety net, NOT a sanctioned location. Pre-deployment dumps must be written
# OUTSIDE this repository entirely — `data.sql` carries `auth.users` today and
# will carry the company's real business data as soon as the pilot has any, and
# a file that is merely gitignored is one `git add -f`, one tooling change or
# one careless glob away from being committed forever. This rule exists only to
# catch the mistake of writing one here by accident.
supabase/dumps
*.dump.sql

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea

# Claude Code local settings (machine-specific)
.claude/settings.local.json
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
